    {
      "text": "[3:77]  As for those who trade away GOD's covenant, and their obligations, for a cheap price, they get no share in the Hereafter. GOD will not speak to them, nor look at them, on the Day of Resurrection, nor will He purify them. They have incurred a painful retribution.",
